#. module: account_bank_statement_import_online
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_bank_statement_import_online.field_online_bank_statement_provider_overlap_days
msgid "Number of days already pulled that every scheduled run requests again.\n"
"\n"
"A day is closed with whatever the provider has published by the time the run happens, and is never requested again: anything published afterwards is lost. Re-checking the previous days recovers it, and costs one extra request per day and run.\n"
"\n"
"Leave it at 0 for providers that publish without delay."
msgstr ""
"Número de días ya descargados que cada pasada planificada vuelve a pedir.\n"
"\n"
"Un día se cierra con lo que el proveedor haya publicado en el momento de la pasada, y no se vuelve a pedir nunca: lo que se publique después se pierde. Volver a comprobar los días anteriores lo recupera, y cuesta una petición más por cada día y pasada.\n"
"\n"
"Déjelo a 0 para proveedores que publican sin retraso."

#. module: account_bank_statement_import_online
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_bank_statement_import_online.field_online_bank_statement_provider_overlap_days
msgid "Re-check previous days"
msgstr "Volver a comprobar días anteriores"

#. module: account_bank_statement_import_online
#: sql_constraint:online.bank.statement.provider:0
msgid "Re-check previous days must not be negative!"
msgstr "¡Volver a comprobar días anteriores no puede ser negativo!"

#. module: account_bank_statement_import_online
#: code:addons/account_bank_statement_import_online/models/online_bank_statement_provider.py:544
#, python-format
msgid "Recovered %s line(s) for %s, a statement that was already closed: that day had been imported incomplete."
msgstr "Se han recuperado %s línea(s) de %s, un extracto que ya estaba cerrado: ese día se había importado incompleto."

